{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15018","headline":"送彭开府往云中觐使君兄 · 卢纶","name":"送彭开府往云中觐使君兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一门三代贵，非是主恩偏。\n破虏山铭在，承家剑艺全。\n夺旗貂帐侧，射虎雪林前。\n鴈塞逢兄弟，云州发管弦。\n冻河光带日，枯草净无烟。\n儒者曾修武，因贻上将篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}